              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pandaŵi jelejo ŵakulocesya ŵaŵiliŵa, Hagai ni Sakaliya mwanace jwa Ido, ŵatandite kuŵeceta kwa Ayuda ŵiŵatamaga ku Yuda ni ku Yelusalemu. Jemanjaji ŵaŵecetaga mu lina lya Mlungu juŵamlambilaga Ayuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Selubabele mwanace jwa Sheyatiyele ni Yeswa mwanace jwa Yehosadaki, piŵapikene maloŵego, ŵatandite kutaŵa soni Nyumba ja AMBUJE ku Yelusalemu, nipo ŵakulocesya ŵaŵili ŵala ŵalimbisye mitima jemanjajo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
