          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jijojo bwanamkubwa Tatenayi jwa mbali ja kungapilo lyuŵa kwa Lusulo lwa Yufuleti, Setali Bosenayi, ni nduna syakwe ŵajile ku Yelusalemuko kukuŵeceta ni jemanjajo ni kwawusya kuti, “Ana ŵani ŵamlamwile jemanja kuti mtaŵe nyumbaji ni kumalisya lipupa lyakwe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵawusisye soni kuti, “Ana ŵandu ŵakutaŵa nyumbaji mena gawo ŵani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Mlungu ŵalolelaga acimlongola ŵa Ayuda, nipo ŵandu ŵala nganiŵalekasya jemanjajo kutaŵa mpaka pa ndaŵi jiŵaganisisye kuti alembe cikalata cakwawula kwa Mwenye Daliyasi ni kupocela majibu gakwe ga ngani jeleji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aci ni cikalata ciŵatumisye jemanjajo kwa mwenye:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
